OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOutbreaks of rain, heavy and
OL,6,Fpersistent at first, but turning
OL,7,Flighter through the morning with
OL,8,Fbrighter spells in the afternoon, the
OL,9,Fbest of these developing around
OL,10,FInverness and the Black Isle. Rain or
OL,11,Fshowers returning to the Northwest
OL,12,FHighlands.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FOccasional rain or showers,
OL,15,Fbut becoming drier and clearer across
OL,16,FEilean Siar and north Highland. Breezy
OL,17,Fwith the southwest winds strong at
OL,18,Ftimes across the northwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
