OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FRain possible at first
OL,6,Fthrough Lochaber and Speyside, but
OL,7,Fmainly bright with occasional sunny
OL,8,Fspells and a scattering of showers.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,11,FBright spells and showers, some of the
OL,12,Fshowers heavy. A more organised band
OL,13,Fof heavy and perhaps thundery rain
OL,14,Fcould cross from the west on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
